# Gate 1 — Verify Microsoft Graph PowerShell

The previous connectivity lab used Azure PowerShell and:

```powershell
Connect-AzAccount
```

Identity management in this lab will use **Microsoft Graph PowerShell**.

Check whether Microsoft Graph PowerShell is installed:

```powershell
Get-Module Microsoft.Graph* -ListAvailable
```

If necessary, install it:

```powershell
Install-Module Microsoft.Graph -Scope CurrentUser
```

