# Gate 2 — Connect to Microsoft Graph

Connect to Microsoft Graph with the permissions required for this lab:

```powershell
Connect-MgGraph -Scopes `
    "User.ReadWrite.All", `
    "Group.ReadWrite.All", `
    "RoleManagement.ReadWrite.Directory"
```

Verify the Graph connection:

```powershell
Get-MgContext
```

Review the output.

Pay particular attention to:

```text
Account
TenantId
Scopes
```

