# Optional Cleanup

Because this lab creates a highly privileged group, remove the lab objects when they are no longer needed.

First, locate the specific role assignment:

```powershell
$Assignments = Get-MgRoleManagementDirectoryRoleAssignment `
    -Filter "principalId eq '$($GCPAdmins.Id)'"
```

Find the Global Administrator assignment:

```powershell
$GlobalAdminAssignment = $Assignments |
    Where-Object {
        $_.RoleDefinitionId -eq $GlobalAdminRole.Id
    }
```

Remove the role assignment:

```powershell
$GlobalAdminAssignment |
    ForEach-Object {
        Remove-MgRoleManagementDirectoryRoleAssignment `
            -UnifiedRoleAssignmentId $_.Id
    }
```

Remove the group:

```powershell
Remove-MgGroup -GroupId $GCPAdmins.Id
```

Remove Chewbacca:

```powershell
Remove-MgUser -UserId $Chewbacca.Id
```

