# Key PowerShell Pattern

Notice the pattern used throughout this lab:

```text
CREATE
   |
   v
CAPTURE THE OBJECT
   |
   v
READ ITS ID
   |
   v
USE THE ID IN THE NEXT OPERATION
   |
   v
VERIFY THE CHANGE
```

For example:

```powershell
$Chewbacca = New-MgUser ...

$Chewbacca.Id
```

and:

```powershell
$GCPAdmins = New-MgGroup ...

$GCPAdmins.Id
```

This is an important PowerShell automation pattern.

> **Do not assume that a command worked simply because PowerShell did not display an error. Verify the resulting state.**
